an></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>The cvMatch_Template will search a specific object (image pattern) over an image of interest by the user-specified method.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-05-09T02:06:17+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-05-08T03:12:52+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4510,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"572df17d-921b-4fae-8fcd-5066f43bcc43","url":"/taxonomy/term/4510"},{"target_id":4511,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"62d06aef-e978-49cd-99ef-fee932a9d6b2","url":"/taxonomy/term/4511"},{"target_id":4512,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"d792c0db-af07-4c12-b78c-69dca68aa3b6","url":"/taxonomy/term/4512"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1525749655,"last_comment_uid":94,"status":2}],"has_author":[],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"Tutorial for cvMatch_Template","uri":"https://sites.google.com/site/qingzongtseng/template-matching-ij-plugin/tuto1"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":94,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"aa749c9e-5b9a-4fdf-83ce-6b94538fe57c","url":"/user/94"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4004,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_segmentation","url":"/image-segmentation"},{"target_id":4186,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation__RDetoixS3xEu0agR2CebaoB","url":"/pattern-recognition"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-35d